cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "SHAP versus LIME on Clinical Tabular Data: A Reproducible Benchmark of Explanation Agreement, Stability, Fidelity, and Rank-Level Consensus"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark comparing SHAP and LIME across six classifiers and three
  public clinical tabular datasets on agreement, stability, fidelity, cost, and
  plausibility, plus a controlled evaluation of three rank-fusion rules. Eleven
  hypotheses were pre-registered in version control before any result was computed.
